## 📖 About the Project

The **Scientific Calculator** is a Java-based desktop application developed as part of my academic coursework to strengthen my understanding of **GUI development**, **event-driven programming**, and **Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)**.

Built with the `javax.swing` library, the application allows users to perform calculations using an interactive button-based interface while demonstrating practical implementation of Java desktop applications.

---

## ✨ Features

- 🖥️ Interactive Java Swing graphical interface
- 🔢 Button-based numeric input
- ➕ Basic arithmetic operations
- 🧹 Clear (C) functionality
- ⬅️ Backspace/Delete support
- ⚡ Event-driven button handling
- 🎨 Clean and beginner-friendly UI
- 💻 Lightweight desktop application

